# Vercel Deployment Ignore
# Prevents non-production files, heavy audits, and test suites from bloating Vercel serverless functions and deployment bundle

# Audit reports and internal documentation
docs/
tests/
scripts/
scratch/
storage/
output/pdf/
coverage/

# Redundant documentation files
*.md
!README.md

# Tooling and IDE
.vscode/
.github/
surgical-forge-lab/

# Full ebook files are delivered exclusively through private Blob.
public/assets/ebooks/

# Private resume sources and historical versions never enter deployment assets.
resume-system/output/
resume-system/source/
resume-system/previews/
public/resumes/
